    {"id": "6", "subevent": "Channel 4 announced it would not make further series of Big Fat Gypsy Weddings but would produce six 'Gypsy-themed' one-off specials in the next year."},
    {"id": "7", "subevent": "In March, media regulator Ofcom dismissed complaints that the TV campaign breached broadcasting codes."}
  ]
}

